{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026adQ4pyWjkS1794609902.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價個別發展。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合140.62元，比本港收市高0.72元。工商銀行7.96元，高4仙。建設銀行10.52元，高2仙。友邦保險78.08元，高0.33元。港交所380.9元，高2.5元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股390.24元，高3.64元。阿里巴巴92.56元，高2.01元。理想汽車45.7元，高1.18元。金沙中國10.67元，與本港收市價持平。長和68.73元，低2仙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.739142+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:58:37.584756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:30:18.958693+00:00","content_hash":"9bc005fa0e5d43fc83915048a7636c219c7a1e5273390a0a17f0e629f2977947","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.739142+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}